<title>USA: Great Atlantic &amp; Pacific names Haub co-CEO.</title>
<headline>Great Atlantic &amp; Pacific names Haub co-CEO.</headline>
<dateline>MONTVALE, N.J. 1997-04-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Great Atlantic &amp; Pacific Tea Co Inc said on Wednesday that Christian Haub, president and chief operating officer, has been elected co-chief executive officer, effective immediately.</p>
<p>Haub will serve jointly with James Wood, who was named A&amp;P's chief executive in 1980, the company said.</p>
